Transactions support explicitly selected large page sizes.

========== API ==========

transactions({ order: 'newest', page: 1, pageSize: 101 })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Expenses:Shop

2024-01-01 First
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -10 SEK

2024-01-02 Second
